  {
    title: "Automatic Flood Alert System Using IoT",
    venue: "9th International Conference on Electrical Energy Systems (ICEES), IEEE",
    description: "IoT-based solution for flash flood risk mitigation from hydroelectric dams. A centralized database connects national hydropower stations, automating alerts to residents in high-risk areas as water levels rise.",
